{"id":"retrete","lemma":"retrete","pos":"noun","rank":4912,"glosses":["toilet"],"ipa":"/reˈtɾete/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"retretes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-retrete.wav","examples":[{"text":"He cambiado el retrete.","en":"I replaced the toilet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/509071","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"changed"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Tom tiró las drogas al retrete y tiró de la cadena.","en":"Tom threw the drugs into the toilet and flushed it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/802769","words":[null,{"g":"to drop intentionally","l":"tirar"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"drug","l":"droga"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to drop intentionally","l":"tirar"},null,null,{"g":"chain"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tom le pidió a Mary que refregara el retrete.","en":"Tom asked Mary to scrub the toilet.","words":[null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to ask for something","l":"pedir"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"A Mary no le gusta cuando Tom deja la tapa del retrete abierta.","en":"Mary doesn't like it when Tom leaves the toilet seat up.","words":[{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"when"},null,{"g":"rest"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"lid, cap"},{"g":"of the"},null,{"g":"the act of opening"}]}]}